{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/superwallkit\/superwall\/subscriptionstatus"]}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A published property that indicates the subscription status of the user. If you’re using a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"PurchaseController","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", you must set this."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12SuperwallKit27PublishedSubscriptionStatusV","identifier":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/PublishedSubscriptionStatus","text":"PublishedSubscriptionStatus","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"subscriptionStatus","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12SuperwallKit18SubscriptionStatusO","identifier":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/SubscriptionStatus","text":"SubscriptionStatus","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"set","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you’re using Combine or SwiftUI, you can subscribe or bind to it to get"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"notified whenever it changes. The publisher only ever emits the merged"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"status – never a value you assigned before granted entitlements were"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"applied. Changes are delivered in the order they were made. Subscribers"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"ty